<title>UK: Deutsche unit adds 150 mln stg bond due Dec 1999.</title>
<headline>Deutsche unit adds 150 mln stg bond due Dec 1999.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Deutsche Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEUTSCHE BANK NV CURACAO</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  DEUTSCHE BANK AG</p>
<p> AMT  **150 MLN STG   COUPON     7.25	MATURITY    30.DEC.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.8855  PAY DATE   *28.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.375     REOFFER    99.698    YIELD	 7.361</p>
<p> NOTES	*PLUS 20 DAYS ACCRUED INTEREST</p>
<p>	     **ORIGINALLY LAUNCHED FOR 150 MLN STG 17.MAY.96</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS ***</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.1875    SELL CONC  1.1875    PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND GILT DUE AUGUST 1999</p>
<p> NOTES	***US/UK/DE/NETHERLAND ANTILLES</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
